TH_Text_MomMorning::
    .string "MOM: You've checked your bag\n"
    .string "three times.\p"
    .string "Go on--OAK's waiting!\n"
    .string "Come home whenever you like.$"

TH_Text_MomRest::
    .string "MOM: There you are!\n"
    .string "Let's give everyone a little rest.$"

TH_Text_MomRecovery::
    .string "MOM: A rough day, sweetheart?\n"
    .string "You're safe at home now.\p"
    .string "Every adventure has a few tumbles.\n"
    .string "Let's get your partners rested.$"

TH_Text_TV::
    .string "Three regions, one research exchange!\n"
    .string "OAK, ELM, and BIRCH are working together.\p"
    .string "Their young trainers will compare\n"
    .string "what they discover close to home.$"

TH_Text_RobinMorning::
    .string "ROBIN: You're late!\n"
    .string "...Okay, I'm early. I couldn't sleep.\p"
    .string "I kept wondering which one I'd pick.\n"
    .string "Come on! Let's go see OAK.$"

TH_Text_RobinGoLab::
    .string "ROBIN: Nine first partners!\n"
    .string "How am I supposed to choose?$"

TH_Text_GateLab::
    .string "OAK is waiting at the lab.\n"
    .string "Your first partner is waiting, too!$"

TH_Text_GateBattle::
    .string "ROBIN is waiting outside the lab\n"
    .string "for your first friendly battle.$"

TH_Text_GateSupplies::
    .string "OAK still has your travel supplies.\n"
    .string "Visit the lab before heading out.$"

TH_Text_ClosedDoor::
    .string "Nobody's home right now.$"

TH_Text_LabSign::
    .string "PROFESSOR OAK'S LAB\n"
    .string "Three-Region Research Exchange$"

TH_Text_TownSign::
    .string "PALLET TOWN\n"
    .string "Small beginnings. Wide horizons.$"

TH_Text_OakResearch::
    .string "OAK: Good morning, {PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "A special day, isn't it?\p"
    .string "ELM studies how POKéMON grow.\n"
    .string "BIRCH studies the places they live.\p"
    .string "We've exchanged first partners from\n"
    .string "KANTO, JOHTO, and HOENN.\p"
    .string "Explore. Learn. Notice the little\n"
    .string "things you might otherwise miss.\p"
    .string "Each display holds three choices.\n"
    .string "Take your time meeting all nine!$"

TH_Text_ChooseDisplay::
    .string "OAK: Which partner feels right?\n"
    .string "Try a display to see its choices.$"

TH_Text_RobinThinking::
    .string "ROBIN: I'm going to pick first!\n"
    .string "...After you. I need another minute.$"

TH_Text_KantoDisplay::
    .string "KANTO first partners:\n"
    .string "A familiar place to begin.$"

TH_Text_JohtoDisplay::
    .string "JOHTO first partners:\n"
    .string "Sent with care by PROFESSOR ELM.$"

TH_Text_HoennDisplay::
    .string "HOENN first partners:\n"
    .string "Sent with care by PROFESSOR BIRCH.$"

TH_Text_ConfirmPartner::
    .string "Choose {STR_VAR_1}\n"
    .string "as your first partner?$"

TH_Text_ReceivedPartner::
    .string "{PLAYER} received {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
    .string "Your adventure begins together.$"

TH_Text_RobinChoice::
    .string "ROBIN: Then I'll choose...\n"
    .string "{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
    .string "I think we'll make a great team.\n"
    .string "Meet me outside when you're ready!$"

TH_Text_AlreadyChosen::
    .string "Your first partner is already\n"
    .string "waiting for an adventure with you.$"

TH_Text_GrantFailed::
    .string "OAK: Let's check your party first.\n"
    .string "Come speak with me again.$"

TH_Text_Supplies::
    .string "OAK: Take this research POKéDEX,\n"
    .string "five POKé BALLS, and two POTIONS.\p"
    .string "The POKéDEX can record partners\n"
    .string "from all three regions.$"

TH_Text_OakSendoff::
    .string "OAK: Travel at your own pace.\n"
    .string "A good question is a fine discovery.$"

TH_Text_BagFull::
    .string "OAK: Make a little room in your BAG,\n"
    .string "then talk to me for your supplies.$"

TH_Text_BeforeBattle::
    .string "ROBIN: Our very first battle!\n"
    .string "Right here, where it all began.\p"
    .string "Ready, {PLAYER}?\n"
    .string "Let's see what our partners can do!$"

TH_Text_BattlePlayerLost::
    .string "ROBIN: We did it!\n"
    .string "That was so close!$"

TH_Text_BattlePlayerWon::
    .string "ROBIN: Already?\n"
    .string "You're a natural!$"

TH_Text_RobinAfterWin::
    .string "ROBIN: I really thought I'd win.\n"
    .string "...But that was brilliant!\p"
    .string "Next time, I'm making you work\n"
    .string "a little harder for it.$"

TH_Text_RobinAfterLoss::
    .string "ROBIN: I won! I actually won!\n"
    .string "...Hey, you did well too.\p"
    .string "We'll get better together.\n"
    .string "That's what friends are for, right?$"

TH_Text_RobinRoute::
    .string "ROBIN: Everyone's feeling better now.\n"
    .string "I'll meet you near VIRIDIAN!\p"
    .string "Don't rush past everything.\n"
    .string "We've got a whole first day.$"

TH_Text_CatchHelp::
    .string "Wild POKéMON hide in the grass.\n"
    .string "Weaken one, then try a POKé BALL.\p"
    .string "Keep an eye on your partner's health.\n"
    .string "There's no shame in heading home.$"

TH_Text_BirdLocal::
    .string "See that HOOTHOOT by the tree?\n"
    .string "I don't usually see them here.\p"
    .string "Maybe it found somewhere it likes.\n"
    .string "It certainly looks comfortable.$"

TH_Text_HoothootFirst::
    .string "A HOOTHOOT rests beside the tree.\n"
    .string "One sleepy eye follows you.\p"
    .string "It settles back down, quite at home.\n"
    .string "Something to tell OAK about someday.$"

TH_Text_HoothootRepeat::
    .string "HOOTHOOT is still resting peacefully.$"

TH_Text_Ending::
    .string "ROBIN: There you are!\n"
    .string "We made it to VIRIDIAN.\p"
    .string "It's only one route from home...\n"
    .string "So why does everything feel new?\p"
    .string "I'm glad we started together,\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "Tomorrow, we can argue about\n"
    .string "who gets to the next town first.$"

TH_Text_DemoComplete::
    .string "THREE HORIZONS - Opening Demo\n"
    .string "Thank you for playing!\p"
    .string "You can SAVE from the menu\n"
    .string "or walk back and explore.\p"
    .string "More of the journey lies ahead.$"

TH_Text_EndingRepeat::
    .string "ROBIN: I'll be right here.\n"
    .string "Take another look around if you like.$"

TH_Text_Boundary::
    .string "The rest of VIRIDIAN lies ahead\n"
    .string "in a future demo.\p"
    .string "You can head back to ROUTE 1\n"
    .string "and PALLET TOWN.$"

